### POST request to run workflow
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/workflows/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photo_shoot_name": "Understated Navy Swimwear",
  "block_names": [
    "art_director",
    "prompt_architect",
    "media_producer",
    "art_critic",
    {"on_good": [], "on_bad": [], "always": ["social_media_specialist"]}
  ],
  "context": {
    "brief": "A photo of a woman in a black and blue one-piece swimsuit. She is around a size 16 — beautiful but understated. The shoot has a professional, artistic, detail-oriented feel. Think photo shoot director aesthetic: focus on mood, styling, composition, lighting, and technical direction. Natural beauty, confidence, and elegance."
  }
}

### POST request to run workflow
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/workflows/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "photo_shoot_name": "Golden Hour Editorial",
  "block_names": [
    "art_director",
    "prompt_architect",
    "media_producer",
    "art_critic",
    {"on_good": [], "on_bad": [], "always": ["social_media_specialist"]}
  ],
  "context": {
    "brief": "A high-fashion cinematic editorial shot during the golden hour. The subject is a stunning woman (size 16) with an elegant, confident poise. She wears a sophisticated one-piece swimsuit in deep navy and obsidian black. The aesthetic is sensually evocative, focusing on the curves of her form and the tactile texture of her skin. Lighting is dramatic: one side of her face and body is kissed by warm amber light, while the other falls into deep, velvety shadows. The mood is intimate and sultry. Close-up shots focus on the detail of a wet curl of hair, the curve of her shoulder, and the subtle sheen of damp skin. High-end aesthetic, 8k resolution, shot on a Leica M11 with a 50mm Noctilux lens for creamy bokeh and sharp focal points. The atmosphere is thick with sophisticated allure."
  }
}

### GET request to check job status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/workflows/jobs/12

